報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 68.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.50"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":22.95,"default_fair_val":22.95,"premium_pct":89.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":23,"pe_forward":20.2,"pb_trailing":2.2,"pb_forward":2,"div_yield":2.68,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":2.78,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":68.3,"cash_to_assets":0.2,"current_ratio":0.5,"roe":9.5,"roa":2.4,"moat":{"ticker":"NI","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"NiSource 屬於受監管的公用事業公司，其定價權主要來自監管機構的批准，而非強大的品牌或定價能力。公司品牌在消費者心中並無顯著差異化優勢，消費者選擇能源供應商的自由度有限，且轉換成本高，但這更多是行業特性而非品牌力量。因此，在品牌定價權方面得分較低。","comment_en":"NiSource operates as a regulated utility, where pricing power is primarily derived from regulatory approvals rather than strong brand equity or pricing strategies. The company's brand does not hold significant differentiation in the minds of consumers. While customer choice of energy providers is limited and switching costs are high, this is more an industry characteristic than a brand-driven moat. Therefore, the score for brand pricing power is low."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為受監管的公用事業公司，NiSource 的核心業務受到嚴格的政府監管和特許經營權保護。這提供了穩定的收入來源和進入壁壘，因為新的競爭者難以獲得類似的運營許可。監管環境雖然帶來穩定性，但也限制了利潤率的擴張。這種受監管的特許經營權是其主要的護城河。","comment_en":"As a regulated utility, NiSource's core business is protected by strict government regulation and franchise rights. This provides a stable revenue stream and significant barriers to entry, as new competitors find it difficult to obtain similar operating licenses. While the regulatory environment ensures stability, it also caps profit margin expansion. These regulated franchise rights constitute its primary moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"公用事業行業的轉換成本極高。客戶需要更換基礎設施（如管道、電線）才能更換供應商，這在經濟上和技術上都是不切實際的。這種高轉換成本為 NiSource 提供了穩定的客戶基礎和可預測的收入流，是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Switching costs in the utility sector are exceptionally high. Customers would need to replace fundamental infrastructure (like gas pipelines or electrical wiring) to change providers, making it economically and technically impractical. This high switching cost secures a stable customer base and predictable revenue streams for NiSource, forming a significant part of its moat."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NiSource 的業務模式（分銷天然氣和電力）不具備顯著的網絡效應。其基礎設施的價值主要在於其物理連接性，而非用戶數量增加帶來的邊際效益遞增。因此，網絡效應對其護城河貢獻甚微。","comment_en":"NiSource's business model of distributing natural gas and electricity does not exhibit significant network effects. The value of its infrastructure lies primarily in its physical connectivity rather than the increasing marginal benefits derived from a growing user base. Consequently, network effects contribute very little to its moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"作為大型公用事業公司，NiSource 受益於規模經濟，尤其是在基礎設施建設、維護和採購方面。龐大的客戶基礎有助於分攤固定成本，使其單位成本低於小型競爭者。然而，監管環境限制了其利用規模優勢大幅超越競爭對手的空間。","comment_en":"As a large utility company, NiSource benefits from economies of scale, particularly in infrastructure construction, maintenance, and procurement. Its extensive customer base helps spread fixed costs, leading to lower per-unit costs compared to smaller competitors. However, the regulated environment limits the extent to which it can leverage scale advantages to significantly outperform rivals."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NiSource 在其服務的特定地理區域內擁有關鍵的基礎設施資產，如天然氣管道網絡。這些資產的地理位置和規模使其難以被複製，並為其在這些區域內提供了近乎壟斷的地位。這些區域性的資產是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"NiSource possesses critical infrastructure assets, such as its natural gas pipeline network, within its specific service territories. The geographic location and scale of these assets make them difficult to replicate, granting it a near-monopolistic position within these areas. These regional assets serve as a significant moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"NiSource 在運營效率方面表現平平。雖然公司致力於提高效率以滿足監管機構的要求並控制成本，但公用事業行業的運營本質上是資本密集且受監管的，這限制了顯著超越同行的效率提升空間。其 ROE 和 ROA 指標處於行業平均水平。","comment_en":"NiSource's operational efficiency is moderate. While the company strives to improve efficiency to meet regulatory requirements and control costs, the capital-intensive and regulated nature of the utility industry limits significant efficiency gains beyond its peers. Its ROE and ROA metrics are around the industry average."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NiSource 的資本配置策略主要集中在基礎設施的維護、升級和擴張，以滿足監管要求和不斷增長的需求。公司在股息支付和適度的債務管理方面表現穩健。然而，相較於能進行大規模戰略性收購或股票回購的企業，其資本配置的靈活性和潛在回報有限。","comment_en":"NiSource's capital allocation strategy primarily focuses on maintaining, upgrading, and expanding its infrastructure to meet regulatory demands and growing needs. The company demonstrates stability in dividend payments and moderate debt management. However, compared to companies capable of large-scale strategic acquisitions or share buybacks, its capital allocation flexibility and potential returns are limited."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"由於高轉換成本和公用事業的必需性，NiSource 擁有極高的客戶保留率。客戶幾乎沒有選擇其他供應商的動機，這保證了穩定的收入流。這種客戶黏性是其業務模式的關鍵組成部分，構成了穩固的護城河。","comment_en":"Due to high switching costs and the essential nature of utility services, NiSource enjoys exceptionally high customer retention rates. Customers have little incentive to switch to alternative providers, ensuring a stable and predictable revenue stream. This customer stickiness is a critical component of its business model and forms a solid moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"NiSource 的業務具有高度的持久性。作為提供必需能源的公用事業公司，其服務需求穩定且不受經濟週期影響。監管框架提供了長期穩定性，儘管也限制了增長潛力。其基礎設施的長期性質也意味著其業務的持續性。","comment_en":"NiSource's business possesses a high degree of durability. As a utility provider of essential energy, its services are in stable demand and are largely insulated from economic cycles. The regulatory framework provides long-term stability, although it also caps growth potential. The long-lived nature of its infrastructure further implies the persistence of its business operations."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"NiSource 的護城河主要建立在其受監管的特許經營權、極高的客戶轉換成本以及在特定區域內關鍵基礎設施的壟斷地位之上。這使其成為一個典型的「收費橋」或「特許經營」類型的公司，提供必需的服務，收入穩定但增長有限。品牌、網絡效應和顯著的成本優勢（相較於其他公用事業）並非其核心競爭力。儘管面臨監管風險和資本密集型的挑戰，但其業務的持久性和客戶黏性提供了相當穩固的長期價值。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"NiSource's moat is primarily built upon its regulated franchise rights, extremely high customer switching costs, and the near-monopolistic position of its critical infrastructure within specific service territories. This positions it as a classic 'toll bridge' or 'franchise' type business, providing essential services with stable but limited growth. Brand, network effects, and significant cost advantages (relative to other utilities) are not its core strengths. Despite regulatory risks and capital-intensive challenges, the durability of its business and customer stickiness offer considerable long-term value.","evidenceHash":"44606db496ed1e7b3999d8b5156cb77cb49a954cbfd12270e58aaf56bdf59923","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"84edca1d83d36e98aa2524c09c15fd86224c0adeb74406ac853078a714bfde52"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"84edca1d83d36e98aa2524c09c15fd86224c0adeb74406ac853078a714bfde52"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NI.png","website":"https://www.nisource.com","ceo":"Lloyd Yates","full_time_employees":"7703","description":"NiSource Inc., an energy holding company, operates as a regulated natural gas and electric utility company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Columbia Operations and NIPSCO Operations. The company provides natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers through approximately 37,300 miles of distribution main pipeline and the associated individual customer service lines; and 310 miles of transmission main pipeline in Ohio, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Kentucky, and Maryland. It also generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.5 million customers in various counties in the northern part of Indiana, as well as engages in wholesale electric and transmission transactions. It owns and operates steam coal generating stations in Wheatfield and Michigan City; combined cycle gas turbine in West Terre Haute; natural gas generating units in Wheatfield; hydro generating plants in Carroll County and White County; wind generating units in White County; and solar generating units in Sullivan County, Gibson County, Jasper County, and White County. The company was formerly known as NIPSCO Industries, Inc. and changed its name to NiSource Inc. in April 1999. NiSource Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Merrillville, Indiana.","description_en":"NiSource Inc., an energy holding company, operates as a regulated natural gas and electric utility company in the United States. It operates in two segments, Columbia Operations and NIPSCO Operations. The company provides natural gas to residential, commercial, and industrial customers through approximately 37,300 miles of distribution main pipeline and the associated individual customer service lines; and 310 miles of transmission main pipeline in Ohio, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Kentucky, and Maryland. It also generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.5 million customers in various counties in the northern part of Indiana, as well as engages in wholesale electric and transmission transactions. It owns and operates steam coal generating stations in Wheatfield and Michigan City; combined cycle gas turbine in West Terre Haute; natural gas generating units in Wheatfield; hydro generating plants in Carroll County and White County; wind generating units in White County; and solar generating units in Sullivan County, Gibson County, Jasper County, and White County. The company was formerly known as NIPSCO Industries, Inc. and changed its name to NiSource Inc. in April 1999. NiSource Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Merrillville, Indiana.","description_zh":"**NiSource Inc. (NI) 業務營運精煉報告**\n\nNiSource Inc. 是一家美國的綜合性能源控股公司，主要業務聚焦於受監管的天然氣及電力公用事業。公司透過兩大營運板塊——Columbia Operations 與 NIPSCO Operations——提供服務。\n\n在天然氣業務方面，NiSource 透過約 37,300 英里的配氣主幹管線及相關用戶管線，為俄亥俄州、賓州、維吉尼亞州、肯塔基州及馬里蘭州的住宅、商業及工業客戶供應天然氣。此外，亦營運約 310 英里的輸氣主幹管線。\n\n電力業務則集中於印第安納州北部地區，為約 50 萬用戶提供電力發電、輸配電服務，並參與批發電力及輸電交易。其發電資產組合多元，涵蓋位於 Wheatfield 及 Michigan City 的燃煤電廠、West Terre Haute 的複循環燃氣渦輪機、Wheatfield 的燃氣發電機組、Carroll County 及 White County 的水力發電廠、White County 的風力發電機組，以及 Sullivan County、Gibson County、Jasper County 及 White County 的太陽能發電機組。\n\nNiSource 的營運模式為整合性的公用事業服務，透過自有發電設施及廣泛的輸配電網絡，確保能源供應的穩定性與可靠性。","address":"801 East 86th Avenue","city":"Merrillville","state":"IN","zip":"46410","country":"US","phone":"614 460 6000","full_address":"801 East 86th Avenue, Merrillville, IN 46410, US","range_52w":"38.42-49.21","year_high":49.21,"year_low":38.42,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":38.42,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"BIRMINGHAM MELODY","title":"officer: EVP & Grp President, Utilities","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":37